[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よっしゃい、もういっぱーつ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All right, one more push!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よーしよし、ついてきてるね！\u3000作戦通り！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Perfect, it's following us just as planned!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これ、あたしが断ってたらどうするつもりだったの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What would you have done if I'd refused?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そのときは船を出すしかないかなあって感じでした。\nでも、ウィルベルさんならって信じてましたよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I guess I would've had to take a ship. But I believed you would come through!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ホント、調子いいんだから。\nでも、船より速いし安全なことは保証するわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're really something else. Still, I'd take a broom any day over a ship."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あっ！\u3000な、なんか飛んできます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah! Something's coming at us!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はいはいっ！\u3000よーく掴まってなさい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hold on tight!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひゃあーっ！\u3000あ、あぶなー……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eek! That was close..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あちらさんも結構怒ってるみたいね。\n速度上げていくわよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Looks like our friend back there is getting pretty angry. Time to pick up the pace!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ウィルベル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wilbell"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（アタシは英雄にはなれないかもしれないけど……\n\u3000誰かが英雄になるお膳立てくらいは、できるはず！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I might not be able to become a hero... but I can at least set the stage for someone else to be one!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さあ！\u3000頂獣様１名、ごあんな～い！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then! One Apexi, coming right up!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お待たせ！\u3000頂獣、案内してきたよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sorry to keep you waiting! I brought our Apexi friend!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様！\u3000無事でよかった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank goodness you're safe."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やってくれたね、アルビー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well done, Alvie."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やー、今回は案内人として大変なお仕事だったね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, just doing my job as a guide!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その理屈のつけ方は、お前さんらしくて好きだけどね。\n本気でその身の心配をしてたんだよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I love how you can justify anything. You know I was really worried about you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……まぁ、これ以上どうこう言うのは粋じゃない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Well, no point in arguing about it now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前さんの勝ちだ。アタシは黙って見てるよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You win. I'll just watch from here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え、ちょ！\u3000身体を案じてくれるなら\n戦ってくれないの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, what? If you're so concerned about everyone's safety, why won't you fight?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アタシも自分の好きなようにやるさ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I do things my way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ！\u3000ウィルベルさん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina! Wilbell!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナ、ごめん。勝手に案内してきちゃった",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sorry, Resna. I took the liberty of luring it here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、船も人も無事だよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This way, the ships and passengers are safe!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お手柄だったね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That was quick thinking!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あとはコイツを倒せばいいんでしょ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now we just need to finish this thing off."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ったく、往生際の悪いヤツだぜ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tch, this stubborn beast won't go down easy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ、一緒に戦おう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina, lend us a hand!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000絶対に負けられない！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! We have to win!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "近くで見ると、すっごい威圧感……！\nでも負けるなアルビちゃん！\u3000頑張れ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's so intimidating up close...! But don't give up, Alvie! You can do this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その意気よ！\u3000さあ行きましょ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's the spirit! Let's go!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この化け物は、ここで必ず倒す",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We'll take this monster down here and now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。神聖国の街と民を\n傷つけさせるわけにはいかないわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. We won't let it harm Nova or its people."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前ら！\n最後まで気ぃ抜くんじゃねえぞ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Listen up! Don't let your guard down til the very end!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい！\u3000一手一手、慎重に！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right! Let's push forward!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここまで来てやられるわけには\nいかないもんねっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've come too far to fail now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]